---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Sentences incompatible with Ethotechnics" description="Sentences incompatible with Ethotechnics.">
  <section class="stack-lg institute-screen">
    <h1>Sentences incompatible with Ethotechnics</h1>
    <p>
      These sentences are common in well-intentioned systems.<br />
      They become incompatible when they delay or block repair.
    </p>
    <p>“We meant well.”</p>
    <p>“Edge cases are acceptable.”</p>
    <p>“We’ll fix it later.”</p>
    <p>“We can’t tell you why.”</p>
    <p>“The model decided.”</p>
    <p>“Pending is not an outcome.”</p>
    <p><strong>If a sentence prevents repair, it is incompatible with Ethotechnics.</strong></p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
